          <text id="/data/results_group/res_severe_dehydration_action:label">
            <value>Mete tib Levine, epi itilize sereng pou bay SRO nan tib la. Apre sa, voye l IJANS nan lopital pandan manman an ap ba li ti gout SRO sou wout la. Konseye manman an pou l kontinye bay tete.</value>
